                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The beef in the beef noodle soup was incredibly tender, which surprised me. The broth was delicious and not overly salty ❤️ I also love the home-style noodles. Highly recommended! There\u0027s parking nearby, making it very convenient to get there 😊🍀",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
