                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I only discovered this shop when I passed by during the Chinese New Year. I went to try it after get off work today and ordered three kinds of beef noodles. Our favorite was the clear broth beef noodles 👍 The braised beef tripe was also quite delicious 👍",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "過年時經過才發現這間店\n今天下班過去品嚐看看\n點三種牛肉麵試試看\n我們最喜歡清燉牛肉麵👍\n魯牛肚挺好吃的👍",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
