                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJdbmSOCStQjQRGvTw5PRKwo8/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toSmNtOURMVXBJUlZwSlVFcHFja0pVVEdSdVZYYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "2 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "A pretty good dinner. The braised broth was delicious, not too salty or oily. The thick noodles were chewy but not too soft, and the soup was garnished with fresh diced tomatoes. The beef was also tasty. A very good dining experience. I hope there could be more beef in the portion.\n\nEating mushroom and chicken noodle soup is amazing on a cold day! The chicken wings were also delicious. Thank you for opening a store in Neihu. 🥹",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "滿不錯的晚餐，紅燒湯頭鮮美，不會過鹹過油。粗麵有勁不會太軟，湯有新鮮蕃茄丁點綴，牛肉也好吃，很不錯的用餐體驗。希望牛肉份量可以多一些。\n\n天氣冷的時候吃百菇雞湯麵有夠讚！雞翅也好好吃，謝謝你們來內湖開店。🥹",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
