                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Absolutely delicious, better than the hidden gem in front of the shop. The large bowl of Champion Beef Noodles is incredibly generous in portion size. I recommend ordering the small bowl with half a pound and a half of beef, plus some braised beef tongue and tripe—it\u0027s super tender and flavorful! ❤️",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "相當好吃，比門前隱味好吃，大碗的冠軍牛肉麵份量超足，建議點小碗的半斤半肉再加點滷牛舌跟牛肚，超軟嫩入味❤️",
